Laurent.jpg\" alt=\"Aurora boreal sobre Mývatn (Islandia)\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" onerror=\"this.parentNode.style.display='none'\"><figcaption>Aurora boreal sobre Mývatn (Islandia). <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:039_Northern_lights_over_M%C3%BDvatn_%28Iceland%29_Photo_by_Giles_Laurent.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Foto: Giles Laurent · CC BY-SA 4.0</a></figcaption></figure>",[["Termosfera",1],["Mesosfera"],["Troposfera"],["Estratosfera"]],"Termosfera."],["m","¿Qué capa se mezcla con el espacio exterior?",[["Exosfera",1],["Termosfera"],["Troposfera"],["Mesosfera"]],"Exosfera."]]},{"titulo":"Capas de la atmósfera (2)","nivel":"Nivel 2","texto":["<svg class=\"fig\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 330\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Capas de la atmósfera\">\n<rect x=\"60\" y=\"10\" width=\"400\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#0b1f4b\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"45\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\">+700 km</text>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"46\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Exosfera</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"70\" width=\"400\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#3a0ca3\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"105\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\">80–700 km</text>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"106\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Termosfera</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"130\" width=\"400\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#4361ee\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"165\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\">50–80 km</text>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"166\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Mesosfera</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"190\" width=\"400\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#4cc9f0\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"225\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\">12–50 km</text>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"226\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#123\">Estratosfera</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"